# LIKHA local memory journal (Wave 2J, docs/adr/0050) — disposable
# Layer-2 episodic trail, never canonical truth. Rebuildable from git
# history at any time; must never be committed (see ADR-0050's
# "Security requirements" — a journal entry lists changed file PATHS
# only, but keeping it out of git is still the right default for local
# working state).
.claude/memory/
